# .chezmoiignore — patterns within home/ (the source dir via .chezmoiroot).
# Repo root files are already invisible to chezmoi; these catch accidental additions.

# Documentation and metadata that shouldn't deploy as dotfiles
README.md
LICENSE
CLAUDE.md

# Never deploy secret keys (chezmoi add --encrypt for secrets instead)
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/id_*
!**/*.pub
